o aggravated weapons... hmm...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T03:52:27-08:00","id":1424897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1424790-quietus-drug-lord-poison-king-available-in-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1424888#post1424888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Shit, did I write that? I was really just refering to vampires in my opening bit. Didn't think at all about ghouls. <br /> I looked back on the core books and it seems ghouls soaked as mortals did (besides possibly having Fortitude) <br /> I'm cool with any interpretation for ghouls: Not soaking makes them easier on the masquerade, soaking lethal but not aggravated works, soaking all three is fine... mortals rarely have a lot of stamina so it doesn't make a huge difference. I suppose it makes a big difference if you ghoul a bear. Fire is supposedly less of an issue for ghouls in these early editions, so maybe it'd make sense to have them weak to aggravated weapons... hmm...</div> </div> </div> </div>I think they don't soak fire accordingly even with what you wrote. Fire, true faith etc. Was the exeption.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-20T03:00:04-08:00","id":1425115,"title":"","content":"First review gave me three stars cause of presentation and recommended people take the book for free? Devastated.<br /> Updated with a cleaner look, and bookmarks. Also got rid of the mention of Ghouls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-20T03:40:18-08:00","id":1425124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1424790-quietus-drug-lord-poison-king-available-in-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1425115#post1425115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First review gave me three stars cause of presentation and recommended people take the book for free? Devastated.<br /> Updated with a cleaner look, and bookmarks. Also got rid of the mention of Ghouls.</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Blablabla10 characters","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-20T03:52:11-08:00","id":1425128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1424790-quietus-drug-lord-poison-king-available-in-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1425115#post1425115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First review gave me three stars cause of presentation and recommended people take the book for free? Devastated.<br /> Updated with a cleaner look, and bookmarks. Also got rid of the mention of Ghouls.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry. If it's a consolation to you, I had fun reading it and will take much of it for my own chronicle. Although (and this might be where the consolation ends) I play V5 and will convert those ideas to V5. I really like the approach you took and although I was never a big fan of the hashish and poison thing that was attributed to the Banu Hakim/Assamites, but your interpretation seems to be a good way to console the existing lore with a non-racist approach.<br /> <br /> I will test it during our chronicle and give feedback later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">&quot;Life's barely long enough to get good at one thing. So be careful what you get good at.&quot;</span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26196-saturno","name":"Saturno","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-20T03:58:06-08:00","id":1425129,"title":"","content":"I'm happy to have these ideas converted to V5.<br /> If only V5 would convert all my ideas <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}